ital.</span></span><span class="block mt-1 md:whitespace-nowrap"><span class="inline-block mr-[0.2em] text-white font-polySansSlimWide" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);transform:translateY(20px)">Built</span><span class="inline-block mr-[0.2em] text-white font-polySansSlimWide" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);transform:translateY(20px)">under</span><span class="inline-block mr-[0.2em] text-white font-polySansMedianWide" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);transform:translateY(20px)"><span class="relative inline-block "><span class="relative z-10">10</span><span class="absolute inset-0 z-20 pointer-events-none" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 45%, rgba(255,255,255,0.25) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 55%, transparent 100%);background-size:200% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;mix-blend-mode:overlay">10</span></span></span><span class="inline-block  text-white font-polySansMedianWide" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);transform:translateY(20px)"><span class="relative inline-block "><span class="relative z-10">min</span><span class="absolute inset-0 z-20 pointer-events-none" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 45%, rgba(255,255,255,0.25) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 55%, transparent 100%);background-size:200% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;mix-blend-mode:overlay">min</span></span></span></span></h1><p class="type-body text-text-2 max-w-lg mb-8 sm:mb-10 font-polySansSlimWide" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">Create agents that monitor markets, execute onchain, and learn from every outcome.</p><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><a class="px-8 py-3.5 sm:px-10 sm:py-4 rounded-full bg-white text-bg font-polySansBulkyWide type-btn hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors duration-300" href="/dapp">La